{"pageProps":{"meta":{"id":"obsidian:free-api-gemini-text-20261102","title":"Gemini免费API实测：同一道题，换个型号为什么等了28秒？","date":"2026-11-03","updated":"2026-11-03","summary":"从服务繁忙到换型号返回，展示真实等待时间。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-资源分享","name":"资源分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["资源分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-免费API","name":"免费API","color":"default"}],"image":"/obsidian-assets/free-api-gemini-text-20261102/cover-88fe601f15.jpg","coverBlockId":null,"slug":"free-api-gemini-text-20261102","legacyPaths":[],"lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"article","discoveryName":"Gemini免费API实测：同一道题，换个型号为什么等了28秒？","discoveryCategory":null,"discoveryStage":null,"discoveryUrl":null,"source":"markdown","fixedProductFooter":true},"markdownHtml":"<blockquote>\n<p><strong>摘要</strong>\n从两次503，到换型号完成任务\n黑粉科技 · 2026年11月2日资料与实测</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>第一次调用Gemini，两道题都只收到503服务繁忙。我换成gemini-3.5-flash-lite后，订单和中文改写都回来了：订单等了28.262秒，改写等了18.393秒。这段过程，比一句“Gemini免费可用”更能说明实际体验。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-gemini-text-20261102/image-gemini-price-2908b088c1.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/eec9e2837dcd230df87f3da6-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/eec9e2837dcd230df87f3da6-940.webp 940w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-gemini-text-20261102/image-gemini-price-2908b088c1.png\" alt=\"Gemini官方定价\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"940\" height=\"1200\"></picture></a></p>\n<h2>先给同一份题，不用不同提示词比速度</h2>\n<p>订单里两台设备A各1200元、三台设备B各350元，加80元运费，减130元优惠，正确总价3400元。要求返回商品明细和固定字段。另一个任务是把技术说明压成两句中文，不能丢掉原来的四项要求。</p>\n<p>本次用已有账户，经本机黑粉盒子把请求转发给对应平台。计时从本机发出请求到收完回答，包含网络和服务等待；每个型号的订单题只跑了一次。账户配置为免费档，未读取最终账单。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>请求型号／任务</th>\n<th>完整耗时</th>\n<th>实际返回</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>gemini-3.1-flash-lite&lt;br&gt;订单</td>\n<td>1.695秒</td>\n<td>503；调用失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gemini-3.1-flash-lite&lt;br&gt;改写</td>\n<td>1.422秒</td>\n<td>503；调用失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gemini-3-flash-preview&lt;br&gt;订单</td>\n<td>3.276秒</td>\n<td>200；JSON字段及金额与标准答案一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gemini-3.5-flash&lt;br&gt;订单</td>\n<td>4.252秒</td>\n<td>200；JSON字段及金额与标准答案一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gemini-3.6-flash&lt;br&gt;订单</td>\n<td>4.512秒</td>\n<td>200；JSON字段及金额与标准答案一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gemini-3.5-flash-lite&lt;br&gt;订单</td>\n<td>28.262秒</td>\n<td>200；JSON字段及金额与标准答案一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gemini-3.5-flash-lite&lt;br&gt;改写</td>\n<td>18.393秒</td>\n<td>200；已返回，四项信息保留</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>本机经黑粉盒子转发；每行一次请求，非多轮平均。耗时包含网络和上游等待。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-gemini-text-20261102/image-gemini-chart-6c7de8c1e3.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/d31807ffe8d5958cfad6fb68-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/d31807ffe8d5958cfad6fb68-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-gemini-text-20261102/image-gemini-chart-6c7de8c1e3.png\" alt=\"订单请求实测数据\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1500\" height=\"757\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>最先请求的gemini-3.1-flash-lite，两次错误都写明当前需求过高。后面换型号重新发原任务，没有改得更简单，也没有把错误页从记录里删掉。</p>\n<h2>28秒以后，拿到的是完整结果</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-JSON\">{\n  &quot;items&quot;: [\n    {\n      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;设备A&quot;,\n      &quot;quantity&quot;: 2,\n      &quot;unit_price&quot;: 1200,\n      &quot;subtotal&quot;: 2400\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;设备B&quot;,\n      &quot;quantity&quot;: 3,\n      &quot;unit_price&quot;: 350,\n      &quot;subtotal&quot;: 1050\n    }\n  ],\n  &quot;shipping&quot;: 80,\n  &quot;discount&quot;: 130,\n  &quot;total&quot;: 3400\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>更换型号后的订单原始返回</p>\n<p>商品名、数量、小计、运费、优惠和总价都与标准答案一致。28秒里包含网络和服务端等待，也可能包含模型内部处理；这次没有保存足够的阶段计时，不能把全部时间都算作“思考”。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-中文改写原始返回\">每天自动重置免费额度，每任务限生成一张图。若失败会保留错误信息，需自行申请密钥使用。\n</code></pre>\n<p>后面另外三个型号的订单请求分别是3.276秒、4.252秒和4.512秒，也都做对了。名字里有Lite，不等于每次端到端都更快；选择时把你真正要完成的任务跑一遍，比根据名字猜快慢可靠。</p>\n<h2>免费档和付费档，接入时别混在一起</h2>\n<p>从<a href=\"https://aistudio.google.com/api-keys\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://aistudio.google.com/api-keys\">Google AI Studio密钥页</a>创建自己的项目和密钥，按<a href=\"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/quickstart\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/quickstart\">官方快速开始</a>接入。免费权益按项目、型号和支持地区生效；同一个品牌名，文字理解、图片生成和语音生成的权益也各不相同。本文只把这次跑过的文字能力列为实测。</p>\n<p>官网新手文档当前以Interactions接口演示，而本轮黑粉盒子使用已有文字路由。文档推荐的最新型号与本文实际请求型号分开看：表里保留的是当时发出的真实名字，不用新名字替换旧记录。</p>\n<p>在第三方客户端配置时，选择它明确支持的Gemini接口或按官方文档设置兼容接口。Google密钥、其他平台密钥和本地路由令牌是不同钥匙，填错位置无法互相代用。</p>\n<h2>遇到繁忙，软件该怎么处理</h2>\n<p>503适合稍后重试，429表示受到限流；二者都应保留原始错误和任务状态。文字请求尚可重新发送，图片、视频等异步任务还需要确认原任务有没有提交成功，避免重复生成。</p>\n<p>我会在界面里让用户知道正在等待、收到繁忙，还是已经拿到完整答案。把“正在生成”一直挂着，最后悄悄换成另一家服务，既看不出失败，也没法比较实际体验。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>引用：我的判断</strong>\nGemini的免费文字入口值得放进候选，但型号必须单独试。本次已有完整正确回答，也有503和较长等待。对等待敏感的任务，先拿自己的短任务测一遍完整耗时，再决定默认型号。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>主要查证来源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing\">Gemini API官方定价</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://aistudio.google.com/api-keys\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://aistudio.google.com/api-keys\">Google AI Studio密钥页</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/quickstart\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/quickstart\">Gemini快速开始</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/rate-limits\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/rate-limits\">Gemini调用限额</a></li>\n</ul>\n","relatedPosts":[{"id":"obsidian:free-api-image-directory-20261102","rawId":"obsidian:free-api-image-directory-20261102","slug":"free-api-image-directory-20261102","legacyPaths":[],"title":"免费绘图API怎么选：免密、周期额度和新人试用资料目录","date":"2026-11-03","updated":"2026-11-03","summary":"先看实际原图，再按免费来源选绘图接口。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-资源分享","name":"资源分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["资源分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-免费API","name":"免费API","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-assets/free-api-image-directory-20261102/cover-b1ccd2dbec.jpg","cover":"/obsidian-assets/free-api-image-directory-20261102/cover-b1ccd2dbec.jpg","source":"markdown","status":"published","lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"article","discoveryName":"免费绘图API怎么选：免密、周期额度和新人试用资料目录","discoveryCategory":null,"discoveryStage":null,"discoveryUrl":null,"sourcePath":"posts/free-api-image-directory-20261102.md","fixedProductFooter":true},{"id":"obsidian:free-api-text-trial-directory-20261102","rawId":"obsidian:free-api-text-trial-directory-20261102","slug":"free-api-text-trial-directory-20261102","legacyPaths":[],"title":"免费文字API试用额度能用多久？新人赠额和评估接口分类整理","date":"2026-11-03","updated":"2026-11-03","summary":"新人赠额、评估密钥和到期条件分类整理。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-资源分享","name":"资源分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["资源分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-免费API","name":"免费API","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-assets/free-api-text-trial-directory-20261102/cover-fb57d4e283.jpg","cover":"/obsidian-assets/free-api-text-trial-directory-20261102/cover-fb57d4e283.jpg","source":"markdown","status":"published","lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"article","d